designs.apiChange:
POST /sports/games/:id/scene -- new endpoint to take a scene (controller at apps/api/src/sports/sports.controller.ts ~line 180+):
  Route: @Post('games/:id/scene') / @RequireRoles(CONTRIBUTOR+)
  Body: { templateId: string; holdMs?: number } (holdMs defaults to 20000 = 20s if omitted)
  Handler: SportsService.recallScene(tenantId, id, templateId, holdMs):
    1. Validate ownership via this.owned(tenantId, id)
    2. Validate templateId is a GAMEDAY-category sports preset OR same-tenant template (reuse assertOwnedGameRefs pattern at line 907, sports.service.ts)
    3. Calculate expiresAt = now + holdMs
    4. Update Game row: { activeSceneTemplateId: templateId, activeSceneExpiresAt: expiresAt }
    5. Invalidate board cache (line 934, sports.service.ts)
    6. Write AuditLog row (Standard Audit Surface #16): { action: 'SCENE_RECALLED', subject: templateId, details: { holdMs } }
    7. Return updated Game row (optimistic write-back to React Query via writeBack callback, line 2737, use-api.ts)

DELETE /sports/games/:id/scene -- new endpoint to clear the scene (back-to-live button):
  Route: @Delete('games/:id/scene') / @RequireRoles(CONTRIBUTOR+)
  Handler: SportsService.clearScene(tenantId, id):
    1. Validate ownership
    2. Update Game row: { activeSceneTemplateId: null, activeSceneExpiresAt: null }
    3. Invalidate board cache
    4. Write AuditLog: { action: 'SCENE_CLEARED' }
    5. Return updated Game row

Wire into useGameControl (apps/web/src/hooks/use-api.ts ~line 2734) as:
  const scene = useMutation({
    mutationFn: (body: { templateId: string; holdMs?: number }) =>
      apiFetch(`/sports/games/${gameId}/scene`, { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(body) }),
    onSuccess: writeBack,
  });
  const sceneClear = useMutation({
    mutationFn: () =>
      apiFetch(`/sports/games/${gameId}/scene`, { method: 'DELETE' }),
    onSuccess: writeBack,
  });

designs.boardChange:
Board render path at apps/web/src/app/board/[gameId]/page.tsx:
  DISPATCH ORDER (lines ~4107-4270):
    1. Error/loading checks (4107-4153) → return error/loading state
    2. NEW BRANCH (insert ABOVE line 4162):
       if (data.activeSceneTemplateId && (!data.activeSceneExpiresAt || new Date(data.activeSceneExpiresAt) > new Date())) {
         // Scene is active and not expired
         return (
           <div style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, right: 0, bottom: 0, left: 0 }}>
             {keyframes}
             <CustomScoreboardScene
               templateId={data.activeSceneTemplateId}
               gameId={gameId}
               initial={displayData ?? data}
               embedded={null}  // Resolved server-side in getBoard payload
             />
             {activeCue && (
               <CueOverlay cue={activeCue} sport={data?.sport} pack={...} />
             )}
           </div>
         );
       }
    3. EXISTING scoreboardTemplateId path (line 4162): if (data.scoreboardTemplateId) render CustomScoreboardScene (unchanged)
    4. EXISTING status-based path (lines 4254-4262): render LIVE/PRE_GAME/HALFTIME/FINAL scenes (unchanged)

When activeSceneTemplateId is null or expired, board falls through to the scoreboardTemplateId path (if set) then to status-based scenes. Celebrations (CueOverlay) still fire on the custom scene layer. Emergency overlay always renders on top.

Board poll at line 3939 (fetch /sports/board/:id every 750ms POLL_MS) picks up the clear automatically on next poll.

